Package: coclustR
Type: Package
Title: Consensus Co-Clustering of Single-Cell Data Across a Parameter Grid
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(person("Luis P","Iniguez", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "inigulu@gmail.com"),
    person("Serafima","Beletskaya", role = c("aut"))
Description: Runs graph-based clustering (Leiden or Louvain on shared nearest
    neighbour graphs, Seurat-style) over a grid of number of principal
    components, number of neighbours and resolutions. Cells with identical
    label vectors across all runs are collapsed into "meta-barcodes", a
    co-clustering (consensus) matrix is computed, unstable meta-barcodes are
    flagged and consensus clusters are obtained by cutting a hierarchical tree
    with 'dynamicTreeCut'. Works with 'SingleCellExperiment' and 'Seurat'
    objects or with a plain embedding matrix, and provides diagnostic plots.
